# bat config — flags applied to every `bat` invocation. One arg per
# line; supports `#` comments. See `man bat` for the full option set.

# Match the terminal's Catppuccin Mocha theme. Other previewers and
# tools share this palette via their own configs (fzf in zshrc, yazi
# in dot_config/yazi/package.toml, etc.).
--theme="Catppuccin Mocha"
